    "about_image_with_text_kz4fLw": {
      "type": "about-image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "caption_EzGaeE": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "Founder story"
          }
        },
        "heading_U9cCAa": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Wild Bliss <em>exists.<\/em>"
          }
        },
        "image_cynGEf": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/div.r45.svg",
            "image_caption": ""
          }
        },
        "text_WkppgW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I was born in Romania and raised in a remote village near the Carpathians, where nature was part of everyday life. As a child, I spent my days fly fishing, gathering wild herbs and berries, and learning the quiet traditions that connected our family<br\/>to the land.<br\/><br\/>Herbal teas were a daily ritual in our home — simple, fragrant infusions made from plants collected with care and enjoyed across generations. Years later, after moving to the United States, I searched for the same herbs I remembered from childhood, but the teas I found often lacked the vivid aroma, flavor, and botanical character I grew up with. It became clear to me that true quality depends not only on the plant itself, but on the care taken after harvest.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "block_quote_PDLNnn": {
          "type": "block_quote",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Wild Bliss was born from that belief: pure Romanian botanicals,<br\/>carefully sourced and thoughtfully crafted with respect for origin,<br\/>freshness, and tradition.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "attribution_HkW4xE": {
          "type": "attribution",
          "settings": {
            "text": "— S.I. Farcas, Founder"
          }
        }
      },
